/hrkt12d0wM","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2099324995390632197"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:18:08.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2099321771690451040"],"id":"2099321771690451040","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1429,"like_count":13,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"人生准则是头痛砍头手痛剁手，在这个世界上唯一能有掌控力的是自己的身体零部件和生命","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2099321771690451040"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:10:22.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2099319816020750581"],"id":"2099319816020750581","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1733,"like_count":19,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"早知道大学这样我就应该把高考条形码吃了.","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2099319816020750581"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-09-14T00:21:47.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2099292490268647503"],"id":"2099292490268647503","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":1779,"like_count":21,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":0},"text":"贪心的我不仅想要通知20+还想要私信20+","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2099292490268647503"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-09-14T00:21:13.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2099292350547931320"],"id":"2099292350547931320","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":1579,"like_count":17,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":2},"text":"卧槽，你他妈以为我不想感知幸福吗？天天和个傻子一样，看到阳光就哇好舒服看到花就哇好香看见流浪狗就哇好可爱，我他妈就是呼吸一下就能被惹，但是我也就窝囊地说爸爸要被你们气死了，仅此而已","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2099292350547931320"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-09-14T00:15:31.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2099290915991130377"],"id":"2099290915991130377","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":1355,"like_count":15,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":2},"text":"其实论粘人我可能比狗屎更胜一筹","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2099290915991130377"},{"author